    hook_en: 'What connects an asset-light tech marketplace in Silicon Valley, a dairy cooperative in Gujarat, a discount stockbroker in Bengaluru, an outdoor apparel brand in California, and a local bakery in your hometown? When you strip away the industry buzzwords, every enduring, profitable business on earth is built upon the exact same foundational laws of human psychology, value creation, and arithmetic. What are these timeless patterns?',
